      "content": "retinal detachment?? ugh that sounds so serious. i dont think i can make it to a specialist tonight though, they all say they're closed until morning and hospitals are just way too expensive for something that might just be floaters. do u think there's any eye drops or like an over the counter thing i can take to make the spots go away or help the shadow clear up? i just really need to get through tomorrow night.",
